<#78b4ff>INVISIBLE AIR</>
Strike Air		^X
  Blasts the wind sheath off Excalibur. Her sword stays
  out until she is hit, using her sword-out moves.
  Excalibur can only be used while the sword is out.

<#78b4ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  her open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second
  cooldown.
Meter Charge (hold)		^B_+^C
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B

<#78b4ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Command Normals		_F^B / _B^B / _F^C / _B^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#78b4ff>SPECIALS</>
  C is the strongest version.
Mana Burst Charge (mid)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Mana Burst Charge (low)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Mana Burst Rise (ground/air)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Intuition (counter)		_B_D_DB^C

<#78b4ff>SUPERS</>
Mana Burst Charge and Rise (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Covering Fire (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
